		(property "Description" "The RRA78620 (dual) and RRA78640 (quad) are operational amplifiers (op amps) featuring low power consumption and rail-to-rail input and output capabilities. They operate on supply voltages ranging from 1.8V to 5.5V, making them suitable for a wide range of general-purpose applications. The devices are unity-gain stable, ensuring reliable performance across various use cases.The input common-mode voltage range extends 100mV above and below the power supply voltage rails, enabling compatibility with virtually"
